  m_text: 'The second explorable game inside the flames world, Your aim is to try
    and save them, unlocking new abilities to try and conquere the flame.


    Original
    Game Description: Your mission is to destroy the rocket which is trying to destroy
    Earth. You will need to conserve jetpack fuel as the rocket has 4 layers of increasingly
    harder security, they wont play by the rules. Good luck, the fate of humans lie
    within you.'
